ok for an olive canvas jacket and a cloth patch so neatly matched it only shows in strong light. Thomas has a round face with a pronounced chin, with close-cropped dark curls. Thomas touches a knuckle to the chin when searching for a word during a conversation.","personality":"Thomas prefers exact instructions at work and pleasant surprises at home. The two standards occasionally collide, especially when a relative thinks dropping by counts as notice.","agenda":"To check the season dates at the next budget meeting.","family":"Ava Baptiste is Thomas’s second cousin. Thomas asks what the birthday guest would like this year. Ava remembers the birthdays. A present that was perfect at sixteen may be completely wrong at forty. They take the trouble of finding out. Asked about *The small signature*, Ava says, “The big check made my deadline easy. Then the vendor asked me to name the eleven people behind the eleven dollars.”","connections":"Dolores Taylor. Flag collection and published coverage need to describe the same last shift.","familyIds":["AH-R0028"],"connectionIds":["AH-R1426"],"reactions":[{"situation":"The swimmer stays on the steps after the final shift","response":"Thomas checks whether the swimmer intends to go into the water before deciding what help is wanted.","asWritten":"The swimmer stays on the steps after the final shift. Thomas checks whether the swimmer intends to go into the water before deciding what help is wanted."},{"situation":"A customer is short at the till while a queue forms","response":"Thomas keeps the customer's place while they check the amount and gets the impatient people talking about something else.","asWritten":"A customer is short at the till while a queue forms. Thomas keeps the customer's place while they check the amount and gets the impatient people talking about something else."},{"situation":"When a visitor arrives unexpectedly","response":"Thomas clears one chair and says honestly how long the visit can last.","asWritten":"When a visitor arrives unexpectedly, Thomas clears one chair and says honestly how long the visit can last."}]},"appearanceSource":"biography casting design"}},{"mesh":6,"name":"Hair_afro01","skin":0},{"mesh":7,"name":"Cloth_jacket","skin":0},{"mesh":8,"name":"Cloth_tshirt","skin":0},{"mesh":9,"name":"Cloth_jeans","skin":0},{"mesh":10,"name":"Cloth_shoes","skin":0}],"meshes":[{"name":"base","extras":{"targetNames":["gender_female","age_old","weight_min","muscle_max","height_tall","face_nose_width_decr","face_nose_length_decr","face_nose_height_incr","face_jaw_width_decr","face_chin_decr","face_cheekbones_incr","face_eye_size_incr","face_eye_spacing_decr","face_eye_tilt_decr","face_lips_incr","face_mouth_width_decr","face_ear_size_decr","face_forehead_decr","blink_left","blink_right","corr_gender_female__age_old","corr_weight_min__muscle_max","corr_gender_female__muscle_max","corr_gender_female__weight_min"]},"weights":[0.2154,0.25,0.0664,0.2029,0.3172,0.4041,0.5365,0.1106,0.2236,0.3873,0.5153,0.2003,0.0803,0.2473,0.4427,0.3913,0.3784,0.3933,0,0,0.05385,0.01347,0.0437,0.0143],"primitives":[{"attributes":{"POSITION":2,"NORMAL":3,"TEXCOORD_0":4,"JOINTS_0":5,"WEIGHTS_0":6},"indices":1,"material":0,"targets":[{"POSITION":7,"NORMAL":8},{"POSITION":9,"NORMAL":10},{"POSITION":11,"NORMAL":12},{"POSITION":13,"NORMAL":14},{"POSITION":15,"NORMAL":16},{"POSITION":17,"NORMAL":18},{"POSITION":19,"NORMAL":20},{"POSITION":21,"NORMAL":22},{"POSITION":23,"NORMAL":24},{"POSITION":25,"NORMAL":26},{"POSITION":27,"NORMAL":28},{"POSITION":29,"NORMAL":30},{"POSITION":31,"NORMAL":32},{"POSITION":33,"NORMAL":34},{"POSITION":35,"NORMAL":36},{"POSITION":37,"NORMAL":38},{"POSITION":39,"NORMAL":40},{"POSITION":41,"NORMAL":42},{"POSITION":43,"NORMAL":44},{"POSITION":45,"NORMAL":46},{"POSITION":47,"NORMAL":48},{"POSITION":49,"NORMAL":50},{"POSITION":51,"NORMAL":52},{"POSITION":53,"NORMAL":54}]}]},{"name":"Eyebrows","extras":{"targetNames":["gender_female","age_old","weight_min","muscle_max","height_t